# Datasets are private by default.
#
# Anything you drop into data/ is ignored unless it is explicitly un-ignored
# below. This fails closed on purpose: data/local.js will usually describe
# internal infrastructure, and it must not be possible to commit it here by
# accident.
#
# To version your own data, see the "Keeping your data in git" section of
# README.md.
data/*.js
!data/example.js

.DS_Store
